        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Virgo &mdash; 3rd (Cloth Ability) Technique, gained at level 11.</em></p><p><em>Demon Pacifier &mdash; cosmo manifested physically between the palms, then released as light.</em></p><p>You compress your cosmo between your hands for the entire casting, then release it.</p><p>Each creature in the cone takes @Damage[6d8[force]] damage with a basic <strong>Will</strong> save &mdash; this strikes the spirit, not the body. A creature that fails is stunned 1; one that critically fails is stunned 3 and <strong>cannot use reactions</strong> for 1 minute.</p><hr /><p><strong>Special</strong> If you release this in the same turn that you open your eyes, spending Om stacks, the cone becomes a <strong>60-foot emanation</strong> centred on you.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The damage increases by 1d8.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
